## Schema Validation

Before processing files, validate against schemas:

```javascript
const schemas = {
  gameState: await Read('engine/schemas/game-state.schema.json'),
  turnSignal: await Read('engine/schemas/turn-signal.schema.json'),
  playerAction: await Read('engine/schemas/player-action.schema.json'),
  logEvent: await Read('engine/schemas/game-log-event.schema.json')
};

// Validate data against schema
function validate(data, schemaName) {
  const schema = JSON.parse(schemas[schemaName]);
  // Use JSON schema validator
  return validateJSONSchema(data, schema);
}
```

