## Helper Functions

### appendJSONL

```javascript
async function appendJSONL(filePath, eventObject) {
  const eventLine = JSON.stringify(eventObject);
  await Bash({
    command: `echo '${eventLine}' >> ${filePath}`,
    description: "Append event to JSONL log"
  });
}
```

### fillTemplate

```javascript
function fillTemplate(template, variables) {
  let result = template;
  for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(variables)) {
    const regex = new RegExp(`\\{\\{${key}\\}\\}`, 'g');
    result = result.replace(regex, value);
  }
  return result;
}
```

### checkIfGamemaster

```javascript
function checkIfGamemaster() {
  // Implementation depends on context
  // Could check agent description, system role, etc.
  // For now, assume all hooks run in gamemaster context
  return true;
}
```

